## Architecture

This is a ONE-PAGE site. All sections live in `app/page.tsx`.
There are NO multi-page routes for about/projects/experience/contact.
The only dynamic API route is `/api/personai`.

## Layout pattern

Every section follows this exact structure:
```tsx
<SpotlightSection id="sectionid" className="py-24 sm:py-28">
  <Container>
    <YourSection />
  </Container>
</SpotlightSection>
```

## Text / i18n

All visible text lives in `content/i18n.ts`.
Access with: `const { t } = useLanguage()`
Never hardcode UI strings in components.

## Scroll animation

Subscribe to `lib/scroll-signal` — NEVER add your own scroll listeners:
```tsx
useEffect(() => {
  return subscribeScroll(() => { /* your animation */ });
}, []);
```

## Non-negotiables

- Section titles: use `<KineticHeading>` — not `<h2>` directly
- Form inputs: use `components/ui/input` and `components/ui/textarea`
- Do NOT reintroduce: `.surface-card`, `.section-copy`, `.eyebrow`, `ScrambleText`
- Run `npm run lint && npm run build` after every change
